       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\n- **Requested dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum dose:** The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under physician supervision, and 2,400 mg/day is the more common ceiling. The OTC limit is 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg in one dose is also well above the usual 400\u2013800 mg per dose.\n- **Risk:** At 6,400 mg/day, the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events goes up substantially, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nPossible intended orders include:\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 600 mg PO four times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 1600 mg total per day, split into divided doses\n\nTell me which regimen you want, and the indication if you can, and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
      }
